    "title": "Bella Thorne's Bikini Video Packs Fun & Flirt Dance Moves - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Evolve Editors ,\n43 minutes ago Image Credit: @bellathorne/instagram Bella Thorne is turning up the sunshine with a new video that shows her dancing on a boat while wearing a stylish bikini. In the clip, the actor and singer delivers a mix of flirty and playful moves, giving fans a glimpse of her fun time out on the water. The video was shared on Bella’s official Instagram account with the caption, “Life is too short not to dance any opportunity you get”.\nBella Thorne only needs a bikini to flaunt her dance moves Take a look at the video of Bella Thorne below!\nBella Thorne recently shared a sun-soaked dance video in a bikini on social media, performing playful, flirty moves while enjoying a day out at sea. Filmed aboard a boat with the ocean stretching out behind her, she wore a two-tone bikini, a structured black top paired with high-waisted bottoms featuring tan side panels and completed the look with a cowboy-style hat.\nHer fans were quick to react in the comments, praising her energy and confidence. Top responses included “Glowing”, “I love you, Bella”, and “Teach me your moves, Bella”.\nOriginally reported by Bikki Sharma on RealityTea .\nThe post Bella Thorne’s Bikini Video Packs Fun & Flirt Dance Moves appeared first on theFashionSpot .",
